    "Company About Us Overview Innovation Our Locations Careers Investors Capital Corporate Responsibility Overview Sustainability People Supply Chain Ethics Philanthropy Data Privacy News & Events Newsroom Press Releases Events Blog Posts Shopping for business? Join our business program today to get tiered pricing, rewards for your purchases, and more exclusive benefits. See All Benefits Sign Up Now Tiered Pricing for Business Members Get special rates on select products. New products added monthly. p.nav-promo-tiered-pricing { background-image: url(\"https://www.westerndigital.com/content/dam/store/en-us/assets/business/icons/icon-tiered-pricing-53.png\"); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding-left: 67px; padding-top: 5px; min-height: 60px; } See All Products with Tiered Pricing",
    "WD for Business is designed to support businesses of every size, with easy reordering, flexible payment options, and secure shipping to keep operations running smoothly.",
    "Build your data storage solution confidently with one of the World’s Most Ethical Companies1. As WD continues to provide the foundation for the world’s data-driven future, integrity will remain central to how we operate—and how we continue to earn the trust of customers, partners, and communities around the world.",
    "Business purchasing, simplified. Apply for a dedicated line of credit today.",
    "Get instant credit line approval1 and 30-day net terms.",
    "Integrate with your Accounts Payable and connect POs.",
    "A hassle-free experience that supports company-wide purchasing.",
    "See what’s in stock.",
    "Shop with confidence thanks to real-time inventory status, so you always know what’s available. Get what you need, when you need it.",
    "Custom pricing in three days.",
    "Business members can request a customized quote for any of our products. Our dedicated sales team will review your needs and get back to you within 3 business days. It’s as easy as 1-2-3.",
    "Browse to the product you need.",
    "Click “Request a Quote”.",
    "Complete the form and submit your request.",
    "Need your order ASAP? Choose from two-day and next-day shipping.",
    "Guaranteed authentic products, scalable solutions, and tool built for business growth.",
    "Enjoy tax-free business shopping when you apply for qualifying tax exemptions.",
    "Shop in seconds with our Easy Reorder tool – add previously ordered items without sifting through invoices.",
    "As a buyer, being able to see available inventory numbers through WD’s business program is important to me and helps our business with planning ahead.” - Judy H., Framework Computer Inc.",
    "As a buyer, being able to see available inventory numbers through WD’s business program is important to me and helps our business with planning ahead.”",
    "- Judy H., Framework Computer Inc.",
    "Join WD for Business to gain access to tools, solutions and support built to grow with your business",
    "Absolutely. In addition to larger enterprise businesses, we welcome SMBs (small- to medium-sized businesses), schools and universities, media organizations, professional creatives, and more to join and enjoy exclusive benefits. Whether you’re a reseller, integrator, or using our data solutions for your day-to-day business operations, we invite you to sign up and benefit from our business program today.",
    "In partnership with TreviPay, we are happy to offer a dedicated business line of credit through our WD Credit program. Learn more about WD Credit.",
