      "Details & Exclusions .xf-resizer-text-xs p { font-size: .875rem; } .xf-resizer-disclosures p { font-size:.875rem; }",
      "Fast Shipping Options Need your order ASAP? We offer expedited shipping options — including 2nd Day Air and Next Day Air — for when you need to restock your shelves, fast. Warehouse Locations For orders in North America, we ship from Southern California. For orders elsewhere, we ship from the Netherlands. For more questions, check out our Shipping FAQ.",
      "Why Buy Direct? We work with you to deliver storage and pricing that meet your needs. And by buying direct, you’ll be confident that you’re getting authentic products from the Western Digital family of brands. Sales Inquiry Have a special project you’d like to discuss? Reach out to us — our team of storage professionals will help you find a solution that checks off every box.",
      "Easy Reordering We’ve made it easy to reorder items you’ve already purchased – no sifting through invoices necessary. Access your order history, add past items to your cart, and head to checkout. How to Reorder Products 1. Log in to your business account 2. Click “Easy Reorder” from your “Account” drop down menu 3. View your Order History and select products to reorder 4. Check out as usual",
